   "text": "WHO’S CHECKING YOU OUT? 👀\nImagine attending a networking event and someone spends ages looking at your business, reading what you do and checking out your services...\nThen they quietly walk away without saying a word. 😳\nYou'd want to know who they were, wouldn't you?\nWith GlobalHUB, you can see when businesses are taking an interest in your profile, helping you turn curiosity into conversation and potential opportunities into business.\n💬 Instant Messaging\n🎥 Zoom integration\n🤝 Network and collaborate with other businesses\n🛒 Buy and sell parts, products and services\n🏭 Share capacity\n💰 Collaborate on MOQ costs\nDon't let opportunities quietly disappear.\nwww.GlobalHUB.co.uk\n🎉 Get 3 MONTHS FREE with promo code: GH3\n#GlobalHUB #Engineering #Manufacturing #BusinessNetworking h#B2B #BusinessGrowth #Networking #DigitalNetworking #UKManufacturing #EngineeringUK #Collaboration #BusinessOpportunities",
